msgstr "Moteur de synchronisation : OneDrive Client for Linux {} ({})"

msgid ""
"Sync engine: OneDrive Client for Linux {} ({}) — too old, please update it."
msgstr "Moteur de synchronisation : OneDrive Client for Linux {} ({}) — trop ancien, veuillez le mettre à jour."

msgid "Sync engine: the OneDrive Client for Linux isn't installed."
msgstr "Moteur de synchronisation : OneDrive Client for Linux n’est pas installé."

msgid ""
"Added. Look for \"DriveDeck for OneDrive\" in your applications menu. Right-"
